/T (The Bachelor of Science in Business Information Technology \(BIT\) program is a pioneering interdisciplinary program designed to bridge the gap between business and technology. Accredited by prestigious bodies such as AACSB, this program equips students with the technical expertise and business acumen needed to drive digital transformation in modern organizations.)
